        "r": 543.7145600000001,
        "b": 536.9177099999999
      },
      "content": "NOTICE: Do not remove the oil flinger unless it is damaged. Doing so may result in unnecessary shutdown time or equipment damage.",
      "severity": "note"
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_1228",
      "reading_order": 1420,
      "section": "Disassemble the power end ( LTi )",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 162.00457,
        "t": 522.15771,
        "r": 552.1445900000003,
        "b": 498.91770999999994
      },
      "content": "NOTICE: Use force only on the inner race when you press bearings off  the shaft. Do not use force in situations in which you might break a part. Doing so may result in equipment damage.",
      "severity": "note"
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_1229",
      "reading_order": 1421,
      "severity": "note",
      "content": "NOTICE: Save the bearings for inspection. Do not reuse the bearings. Doing so may result in decreased performance.",
      "section": "NOTICE:",
      "bbox": {
